    "title": "About the Shining Fates set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Shining Fates is a Sword & Shield expansion released on 19 February 2021. It has 73 cards: 72 in the main set and 1 secret rare. There are also 46 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 72 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (118 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 119 cards, adding the 1 secret rare).",
